{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_9d7a0eebacb54db0","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"decoder_type\": \"dense (Qwen3_5, VL-wrapped ckpt -> serve text-only with --language-model-only)\",\n  \"attention\": \"hybrid GDN linear_attention + full_attention (1 of every 4 layers), GQA 24Q/4KV\",\n  \"layer_mix\": \"64 layers: 48 linear-attn (GDN) + 16 full-attn, full_attention_interval=4\",\n  \"kv_cache_per_token\": \"small (only 1/4 layers hold KV); block_size forced to ~848 tokens by mamba/GDN page alignment\",\n  \"active_params\": \"27B total\",\n  \"num_experts\": 0,\n  \"experts_per_tok\": 0,\n  \"mtp\": \"not built into 0.28.0+rocm723 here; fused_gdn_decode_post_conv_mtp falls back to Triton GDN (verified non-bottleneck)\",\n  \"norm\": \"rmsnorm\",\n  \"notes\": \"gfx90a/MI250X PLATFORM LAWS (measured on this box, 2026-09, see /home/qiba/ai docs): (1) AITER INT8 a8w8 ScaledMM LINEAR is VALIDATED and FAST on gfx90a - VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER=1 + VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER_LINEAR=1 select AiterInt8ScaledMMLinearKernel; 'not found tuned config in a8w8_tuned_gemm.csv -> default' is CORRECT behavior, do not chase tuned tables. (2) AITER fused-MoE is DEAD on gfx90a (CK 2-stage bf16 stage2 silently writes zeros; CDNA2 lacks global_atomic_pk_add_bf16). Never propose enabling aiter MoE. Triton fused MoE is optimal for MoE models. (3) FP8/FP4 compute physically absent (no FP8 ALU). fp8-KV storage is UNRELIABLE on 0.28.0+rocm723 (silent fallback/crash) - do not propose --kv-cache-dtype fp8. (4) NEVER enable custom allreduce (use_custom_allreduce) on gfx90a: silently corrupts output ('!!!'). Keep PYNCCL. (5) MoE/INT8 tuned-config seed tables measured WORSE than defaults on this box (A/B) - do not propose them as wins. (6) INT8 and BF16 have equal peak (181) on CDNA2; a8w8 wins via scheduling maturity (~2.9x vs Triton INT8). (7) --safetensors-load-strategy eager is REQUIRED here (loader silently dies without it on this storage). (8) Speculative decoding (dflash) tokens/step is a function of prompt style: random-token benchmark corpora collapse acceptance; measured random-prompt numbers CANNOT judge spec-decode levers. (9) Random-token Magpie corpus IS valid for GEMM/config/graph levers. (10) One MI250X die == one MI210 (gfx90a/104CU/64GiB): INT8 W8A8 27B single-die BF16-out serving hits ~80 tok/s single-stream WITH dflash on natural prose, ~50-65 without; TP=1 preferred for 27B-class weights (no cross-die comm). (11) head_dim=256 for this family: AITER fmha_v3 ASM covers hd128/hd192x128 ONLY — ROCM_AITER_FA is auto-rejected for the decoder here (verified: log 'Found incompatible backend(s)... Overriding with ROCM_ATTN'); the ported ASM FA helps only hd128/192 models, not Qwen3.8-27B. (12) Magpie baseline port 8888 collides with host unsloth-studio (restartable via ~/ai/start-unsloth-studio.sh); port now free.\"\n}===INBOX===\n(no inbox)\n===HINTS===\n# Research Hints\n\n_No proven priors collected yet (scout produced an empty set or all sources are unreachable)._","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2dab10a4-15e5-4e56-9127-90b503bfd566","uuid":"5c48866e-1a54-4530-ab67-164390f5c371","timestamp":"2026-09-15T11:30:43.048Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"decoder_type\": \"dense (Qwen3_5, VL-wrapped ckpt -> serve text-only with --language-model-only)\",\n  \"attention\": \"hybrid GDN linear_attention + full_attention (1 of every 4 layers), GQA 24Q/4KV\",\n  \"layer_mix\": \"64 layers: 48 linear-attn (GDN) + 16 full-attn, full_attention_interval=4\",\n  \"kv_cache_per_token\": \"small (only 1/4 layers hold KV); block_size forced to ~848 tokens by mamba/GDN page alignment\",\n  \"active_params\": \"27B total\",\n  \"num_experts\": 0,\n  \"experts_per_tok\": 0,\n  \"mtp\": \"not built into 0.28.0+rocm723 here; fused_gdn_decode_post_conv_mtp falls back to Triton GDN (verified non-bottleneck)\",\n  \"norm\": \"rmsnorm\",\n  \"notes\": \"gfx90a/MI250X PLATFORM LAWS (measured on this box, 20